    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "pride doesnt pay the rent or help me sleep at night. i'm just sitting here in an empty apartment and it feels like i'm just waiting for something to happen, but nothing ever does. it feels like i'm already dead, just walking around. like there's no version of my life where this ends well. it's just a loop of nothingness.",
