      "content": "what kind of relief? because even when i try to rest i just feel the weight of it all. i feel like i've already lost everything that made life worth living. i'm just exhausted from trying to exist in a world that basically wants me gone. it would be so much easier to just... not have to face any of this anymore. do you think there's actually any way out of this feeling?",
